<%With 
  tgns="context://code/components/"
  tgns:net="class:/java/net/"
  x='[sendCode]'
  %>
  
Hello <%=[sendCode].displayName/%>,

Please enter this code into the login panel to complete your login.

<%=[sendCode].code/%>

This code expires in 10 minutes. If you did not try to log in, you can ignore this message.

<%/With%>